{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074360/extras/2711d02dd273e8943f3077cf859710cc.avif?t=1769981919\" width=560 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Obsessive Shadow, you take on the role of Liam, a 9-year-old</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >boy left alone in his home after the power suddenly goes out, plunging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the house into suffocating darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with only a flashlight, you must navigate the unsettling dangers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >of the night as you are being watched throughout the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mother's voice on the phone is your guide to surviving,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as her instructions grow more confusing and the unease deepens,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the safety of her words begins to feel increasingly fragile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is watching, a shadowy figure moving just out of sight,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >waiting for you to slip up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the hours creep forward, the once-familiar home becomes an</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unfamiliar labyrinth of fear, each corner hiding the possibility of</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >confrontation with the lurking entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testing your courage and instincts as you struggle to stay one step</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ahead of the unseen threat. Your mother's voice remains your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lifeline,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but survival demands more than just following her instructions\u2014it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >requires vigilance,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >quick thinking, and a determination to face the overwhelming dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you endure the relentless terror and make it to morning, or will</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the suffocating darkness claim you before dawn?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created by</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pablo Heckman </strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Piece of Cake!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074360/c4d8d91e1ac6d9ef574db66165ea78a4412276ee.jpg"},{"name":"The Real Deal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074360/1da3296fbe069625b5aab91ac0cd974d2b1c225e.jpg"},{"name":"And Now The Fun begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074360/139fd2ea6672f6c6e60836236d3cc6dec46588a6.jpg"},{"name":"Fearless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074360/9c0a78c10d2c394f6d8e62b291d59e719925b169.jpg"},{"name":"Dedication","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074360/d978d856d2ec365fc82f52e048cf98744b9b73e3.jpg"},{"name":"Oh Hello There!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074360/6884ab7233dda0b5a67280bb68c824cfc5a7daf3.jpg"},{"name":"WEE WOO WEE WOO","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074360/70ca770b2ee8eaaeb34c1cd77feb849836d0f2bb.jpg"},{"name":"Safe at last","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074360/01f4b8adabf0eee7483960da8cf06e79b9eb6d49.jpg"},{"name":"Hunk of junk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074360/2821a54bcc5bed362e0db7509118abc0ccb77985.jpg"},{"name":"Don't look at me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074360/8f18cada03e8814610418c3ed5a51778f5308010.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2074360?t=1769981919","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com